<item><title>Benin court postpones trial over victim&apos;s dreadlocks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-court-postpones-trial-over-victim-s-dreadlocks-f1fb20/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-court-postpones-trial-over-victim-s-dreadlocks-f1fb20/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>A judge in Abomey-Calavi delayed a theft and assault case because the victim wore dreadlocks, citing judicial decorum.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:31:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-court-postpones-trial-over-victim-s-dreadlocks-f1fb20/share.jpg" length="40034" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-court-postpones-trial-over-victim-s-dreadlocks-f1fb20/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
